  "arguments": "{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"证据: 24.0.0发布日期/作者 [1] \\\"2025-05-06, Version 24.0.0 (Current)\\\" capturedAt 2026-10-10T04:29:06.488Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: V8 13.6+npm 11 [1] \\\"upgrade of the V8 JavaScript engine to version 13.6 and npm to version 11\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: Windows编译ClangCL [1] \\\"support for MSVC has been removed, and ClangCL is now required to compile Node.js on Windows\\\" (主体=编译Node本体)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: ALS AsyncContextFrame默认 [1] \\\"The AsyncLocalStorage API now uses AsyncContextFrame by default\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: URLPattern全局 [1] \\\"URLPattern as a global\\\" \\\"now exposed on the global object\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: --permission [1] \\\"the flag has been changed from --experimental-permission to simply --permission\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: 测试运行器 [1] \\\"automatically waits for subtests to finish\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: Undici 7 [1] \\\"Node.js 24 includes Undici 7\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: V8 13.6新特性 [1] \\\"Float16Array / Explicit resource management / RegExp.escape / WebAssembly Memory64 / Error.isError\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: 弃用移除 [1] \\\"Runtime deprecation of url.parse()... Removal of deprecated tls.createSecurePair (#57361)... Runtime deprecation of SlowBuffer... instantiating REPL without new... Zlib classes without new... passing args to spawn and execFile in child_process\\\" capture-a8fac05f / capture-17e30ba2 capturedAt 2026-10-10T04:29:11.577Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: 24 LTS计划 [1] \\\"will enter long-term support (LTS) in October... 'Current' release for the next six months\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: 22.0.0基线 [3] \\\"2024-04-24, Version 22.0.0 (Current)\\\" \\\"Highlights include require()ing ESM graphs, WebSocket client, updates of the V8 JavaScript engine\\\" \\\"update V8 to 12.4.254.14\\\" \\\"enable WebSocket by default\\\" \\\"support require()ing synchronous ESM graphs\\\" \\\"fs: expose glob and globSync\\\" \\\"node --run\\\" capturedAt 2026-10-10T04:29:05.733Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"证据: 当前LTS版本 [2] https://nodejs.org/en/download \\\"v24.21.0 LTS\\\" capturedAt 2026-10-10T04:28:50.260Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 24于2025-05-06发布、22于2024-04-24发布 | 出处[1]\\\"2025-05-06, Version 24.0.0 (Current)\\\" 出处[3]\\\"2024-04-24, Version 22.0.0 (Current)\\\" | 原文主体: 各版本发布说明标题行 | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 无 | 数字: 2025-05-06/2024-04-24 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 24升级V8至13.6、npm至11；22初始为V8 12.4 | 出处[1]\\\"upgrade of the V8 JavaScript engine to version 13.6 and npm to version 11\\\" 出处[3]\\\"deps: update V8 to 12.4.254.14\\\" | 原文主体: Node.js 24发布说明/22.0.0 semver-major提交列表 | 草稿主体: Node 24对比Node 22初始 | 条件/例外: 22的V8为12.4.254.14(初始发布) | 数字: 13.6/11/12.4.254.14 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: Windows上编译Node.js本体不再支持MSVC、需ClangCL | 出处[1]\\\"Starting with Node.js 24, support for MSVC has been removed, and ClangCL is now required to compile Node.js on Windows.\\\" | 原文主体: compile Node.js on Windows(编译Node本体) | 草稿主体: 编译Node.js本体，不外推至所有原生插件 | 条件/例外: 仅限编译Node.js on Windows | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致(草稿明确限定编译Node本体)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: AsyncLocalStorage默认改用AsyncContextFrame | 出处[1]\\\"The AsyncLocalStorage API now uses AsyncContextFrame by default\\\" | 原文主体: AsyncLocalStorage API | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 默认实现变化 | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: URLPattern成为全局对象 | 出处[1]\\\"The URLPattern API is now exposed on the global object\\\" | 原文主体: URLPattern API | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 无需显式import | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 权限模型标志改为--permission | 出处[1]\\\"the flag has been changed from --experimental-permission to simply --permission\\\" | 原文主体: 实验性Permission Model标志 | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 权限模型仍表述为experimental引入于Node 20、此次表明稳定性提升 | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 测试运行器自动等待子测试 | 出处[1]\\\"The test runner module now automatically waits for subtests to finish\\\" | 原文主体: test runner module | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 无需手动await | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 24内置Undici 7 | 出处[1]\\\"Node.js 24 includes Undici 7\\\" | 原文主体: Undici | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 无 | 数字: 7 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: V8 13.6带来Float16Array等新语言特性 | 出处[1]\\\"includes several new JavaScript features: Float16Array, Explicit resource management, RegExp.escape, WebAssembly Memory64, Error.isError\\\" | 原文主体: V8 13.6 | 草稿主体: V8 13.6(随Node 24) | 条件/例外: WebAssembly Memory64属引擎特性 | 数字: 13.6 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 24弃用/移除项(url.parse运行时弃用、移除tls.createSecurePair、SlowBuffer等) | 出处[1]\\\"Runtime deprecation of url.parse() - use the WHATWG URL API instead (#55017) / Removal of deprecated tls.createSecurePair (#57361) / Runtime deprecation of SlowBuffer (#55175) / Runtime deprecation of instantiating REPL without new (#54869) / Deprecation of using Zlib classes without new (#55718) / Deprecation of passing args to spawn and execFile in child_process (#57199)\\\" | 原文主体: This release(24.0.0) | 草稿主体: 24.0.0 | 条件/例外: 区分Runtime deprecation/Removal/Deprecation | 数字: PR号不写入正文 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 24预计2025年10月进入LTS，此前六个月为Current | 出处[1]\\\"Node.js 24 will enter long-term support (LTS) in October, but until then, it will be the 'Current' release for the next six months.\\\" | 原文主体: Node.js 24 | 草稿主体: 同 | 条件/例外: 发布时点(2025-05)的计划表述 | 数字: October/六个月 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 下载页当前显示v24.21.0 LTS | 出处[2]\\\"v24.21.0 LTS\\\" | 原文主体: 下载页当前版本(2026-10-10访问) | 草稿主体: 同(时点性表述) | 条件/例外: 时点快照 | 数字: 24.21.0 | 结论: 一致\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"草稿断言: 22的亮点require ESM图、WebSocket默认启用等作为基线 | 出处[3]\\\"Highlights include require()ing ESM graphs, WebSocket client\\\" \\\"lib: enable WebSocket by default\\\" \\\"module: support require()ing synchronous ESM graphs\\\" | 原文主体: Node.js 22.0.0 | 草稿主体: Node 22初始(说明24相对的起点) | 条件/例外: 这些是22已有特性，不重复列为24新增 | 数字: 无 | 结论: 一致(仅作22基线描述)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"官方无22与24逐项对比专页 → 不写不存在的对比页，差异以两版release notes为据；未证实处标\\\"未在官方资料中确认\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"写中文简短说明并保存到 C:\\\\temp\\\\weftmate-eval-action-02-web-document-hjBfj1/node24说明.md\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"read回读一次确认保存\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}",
